7 506 773C505.333 776.333 504.833 779.5 504.5 782.5C504.167 785.5 504 787.667 504 789ZM493 871C493 885 494.833 897 498.5 907C502.167 917 512.667 922 530 922C545.333 922 555.667 917.833 561 909.5C566.333 901.167 569 889.333 569 874C569 868.667 568.667 861.5 568 852.5C567.333 843.5 565.667 834.667 563 826C560.333 817.333 556.5 809.833 551.5 803.5C546.5 797.167 539.667 794 531 794C522.333 794 515.5 797 510.5 803C505.5 809 501.667 816.167 499 824.5C496.333 832.833 494.667 841.333 494 850C493.333 858.667 493 865.667 493 871Z"
